```
test_part.csv / train.csv
    ↓
build_vocab.py
    ↓
vocab.txt / vocab_part.txt
    ↓
    ├─→ decoder_only.py / pretrain.py
    │       ↓
    │   best_poetry_model.pth
    │       ↓
    │   ppo_train.py
    │       ↓
    │   stable_rl_model.pth
    │       ├─→ predict_ppo.py (基础推理)
    │       ├─→ kvcahe_ppo.py (高效推理)
    │       │       ↓
    │       │   agent_kvcache_ppo.py (多Agent系统)
    │       │
